{
  "name": "MiniMax H3 (Turbo LoRA)",
  "description": "Workflow for MiniMax H3 text to video with native stereo sound (8-step Turbo LoRA)",
  "defaults": {
    "steps": 8,
    "sampler_name": "res_multistep",
    "scheduler": "simple",
    "width": 480,
    "height": 864,
    "length": 124
  },
  "groups": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Model Loaders",
      "member_nodes": ["10", "11", "12", "13", "note:1"]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Turbo LoRA",
      "member_nodes": ["14", "note:2"]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Video Settings",
      "member_nodes": ["1", "note:3"]
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Model Selection",
      "content": "### Recommended Models\n\n- **Diffusion model:** **MiniMax H3 FL2VA** (first/last frame to video, Int8)\n- **Text encoder:** **Qwen3-VL 32B** for MiniMax H3 (NVFP4 AWQ)\n- **VAE:** the MiniMax H3 **video** VAE\n- **Audio VAE:** the MiniMax H3 **audio** VAE\n\n---\n\n*MiniMax H3 generates the picture and its stereo sound together, at 24 fps.*"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Turbo LoRA",
      "content": "### Recommended LoRA\n\nUse **FL2V Turbo 8-step** at strength 1.0.\n\n- **Steps:** 8\n- **Sampler:** res_multistep\n- **Scheduler:** simple"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Video Settings",
      "content": "### Recommended Settings\n\n- **Size:** 480 x 864 for speed, up to 768 x 1344 (the native canvas; multiples of 32)\n- **Length:** 124 frames (~5 s at 24 fps); 5 + 17n, trained on ~124-362\n\n---\n\n*Describe the shots, the motion and the sound (dialogue, effects, music) in one prompt. MiniMax H3 uses no negative prompt.*"
    }
  ],
  "nodes": {
    "1": {
      "class_type": "MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "clip": ["11", 0],
        "vae": ["12", 0],
        "prompt": "{{positive_prompt}}",
        "width": "{{width}}",
        "height": "{{height}}",
        "length": "{{length}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Text to Video"
      }
    },
    "10": {
      "class_type": "UNETLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "unet_name": "{{unet_name}}",
        "weight_dtype": "default"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Diffusion Model"
      }
    },
    "11": {
      "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
      "inputs": {
        "clip_name": "{{clip_name}}",
        "type": "minimax",
        "device": "default"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Text Encoder"
      }
    },
    "12": {
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "{{vae_name}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Video VAE"
      }
    },
    "13": {
      "class_type": "VAELoader",
      "inputs": {
        "vae_name": "{{audio_vae_name}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Load Audio VAE"
      }
    },
    "14": {
      "class_type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["10", 0],
        "lora_name": "{{lora_name}}",
        "strength_model": 1.0
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Turbo LoRA"
      }
    },
    "20": {
      "class_type": "RandomNoise",
      "inputs": {
        "noise_seed": "{{seed}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Noise"
      }
    },
    "21": {
      "class_type": "BasicGuider",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["14", 0],
        "conditioning": ["1", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Guider"
      }
    },
    "22": {
      "class_type": "KSamplerSelect",
      "inputs": {
        "sampler_name": "{{sampler_name}}"
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Sampler"
      }
    },
    "23": {
      "class_type": "BasicScheduler",
      "inputs": {
        "model": ["14", 0],
        "scheduler": "{{scheduler}}",
        "steps": "{{steps}}",
        "denoise": 1.0
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Scheduler"
      }
    },
    "24": {
      "class_type": "SamplerCustomAdvanced",
      "inputs": {
        "noise": ["20", 0],
        "guider": ["21", 0],
        "sampler": ["22", 0],
        "sigmas": ["23", 0],
        "latent_image": ["1", 1]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Sample"
      }
    },
    "25": {
      "class_type": "VAEDecode",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["24", 0],
        "vae": ["12", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Decode Video"
      }
    },
    "26": {
      "class_type": "VAEDecodeAudio",
      "inputs": {
        "samples": ["24", 0],
        "vae": ["13", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Decode Audio"
      }
    },
    "27": {
      "class_type": "CreateVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "images": ["25", 0],
        "audio": ["26", 0],
        "fps": 24
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Create Video"
      }
    },
    "28": {
      "class_type": "SaveVideo",
      "inputs": {
        "filename_prefix": "video/ComfyChair",
        "format": "auto",
        "codec": "auto",
        "video": ["27", 0]
      },
      "_meta": {
        "title": "Save Video"
      }
    }
  }
}
